Package: yesem
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Volo <support@volo.global>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: YesEm Desktop and YesEm Pin Code Manager (test build)
 YesEm Desktop signs documents with an ID card in a card reader. The signature
 PIN is entered in the separate YesEm Pin Code Manager, which Desktop starts
 when you click Sign, and is handed back over loopback HTTP with a one-time
 token.
 .
 Both applications are installed under /opt/yesem, where Desktop finds the
 helper. Only Desktop has a launcher in the applications menu.
 .
 This is a test build: Desktop displays the PIN it received.
